        "Study_Objective": "Obtain packed-bed high-temperature carbonation data for steelmaking slag (temperature, CO2 concentration, space velocity, particle size) and develop a two-site LDF kinetic model validated at kg scale, for simultaneous heat recovery and CO2 fixation in road-base production.",
